4. Métricas de utilización (90 días) - P95

AzureMetrics
| where TimeGenerated > ago(90d)
| summarize
    Avg=avg(Average),
    Max=max(Maximum),
    P95=percentile(Maximum,95)
by ResourceId, MetricName


5. Número de instancias usadas

AzureMetrics
| where MetricName == "InstanceCount"
| where TimeGenerated > ago(90d)
| summarize
    AvgInstances=avg(Maximum),
    MaxInstances=max(Maximum)
by ResourceId


6. Porcentaje del tiempo con una sola instancia

AzureMetrics
| where MetricName == "InstanceCount"
| where TimeGenerated > ago(90d)
| summarize
    SingleInstance=countif(Maximum <= 1),
    MultiInstance=countif(Maximum > 1)
by ResourceId
| extend
    PercentSingle =
        100.0 * SingleInstance / (SingleInstance + MultiInstance)


